{
  "desc": "the host's gate disc with b in another stage group: the instance ends (host_left), b goes home on its own story (a goes into dng101b1 first by the depart action, b, a's friend, arrives at stag0101 as a new stage group of a's instance: the explore bot's k9 fell on stag0101's rock slope on the way to matz00)",
